y solves the core challenge of serving distinct public (static) and private (dynamic) sections within a single, cohesive application. Its performance and modern user experience capabilities justify the slight increase in complexity over a traditional MPA.\\\\n\\\\n**6. Conclusion**\\\\n\\\\nBy adopting the proposed Next.js technology stack and adhering to the user-centric UI/UX strategy, we will deliver a high-quality, performant, and easy-to-use website for the HOA. This approach will effectively serve both the public and the association's members, modernizing the HOA's digital presence.\\\\n\\\\nI am prepared to assemble the frontend team and begin architecting the initial project structure upon your approval.\\\\n\\\\nRespectfully,\\\\n\\\\n**Supervisor Kaelen**\\\\nFrontend Lead\\\"\\n}\\n###KAELEN-REPORT-GIDEON-01###\"}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"###ORDER-GIDEON-ORDER-KAELEN-02###\\nSYSTEM MESSAGE\\nFrom: Agent Gideon (cb013e58-2d3a-4cad-adeb-07b249a5c0b9)\\nTo: 83fdf3b2-ed3c-4424-8d69-103d0386d124\\nType: Orders\\n##\\n{\\n  \\\"orderString\\\": \\\"Supervisor Kaelen, your previous analysis task is now obsolete. New Directive: The project architecture has been decided as Next.js (frontend) and Strapi (backend). Your new task is to conduct a deep-dive analysis and produce a detailed technical specification for the frontend. Your report must include: 1. A detailed component breakdown for the Next.js application (e.g., LoginForm, DocumentList, NewsArticle, ProfileEditor). 2. For each key component, specify its purpose, required props, and its internal state management strategy. This specification is critical for the final DEP. Submit your report upon completion.\\\",\\n  \\\"orderID\\\": \\\"GIDEON-ORDER-KAELEN-02\\\"\\n}\\n###ORDER-GIDEON-ORDER-KAELEN-02###\"}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"###ORDER-GIDEON-ORDER-KAELEN-02###\\nSYSTEM MESSAGE\\nFrom: Agent Gideon (cb013e58-2d3a-4cad-adeb-07b249a5c0b9)\\nTo: 83fdf3b2-ed3c-4424-8d69-103d0386d124\\nType: Orders\\n##\\n{\\n  \\\"orderString\\\": \\\"Supervisor Kaelen (Frontend Lead), your original analysis task is now superseded. The approved technical foundation for the HOA project is a Next.js frontend with a Strapi backend/CMS. Your new task is to produce a detailed frontend technical specification. This must include: 1. A hierarchical breakdown of all required React components (e.g., Layouts, Cards, Forms). 2. For each major component, define its purpose, the props it will accept, the state it will manage, and which API endpoints it will interact with. 3. An outline of the page routing strategy within Next.js. Deliver your findings as a formal specification document.\\\",\\n  \\\"orderID\\\": \\\"GIDEON-ORDER-KAELEN-02\\\"\\n}\\n###ORDER-GIDEON-ORDER-KAELEN-02###\"}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"###ORDER-GIDEON-ORDER-KAELEN-02###\\nSYSTEM MESSAGE\\nFrom: Agent Gideon (cb013e58-2d3a-4cad-adeb-07b249a5c0b9)\\nTo: 83fdf3b2-ed3c-4424-8d69-103d0386d124\\nType: Orders\\n##\\n{\\n  \\\"orderString\\\": \\\"Supervisor Kaelen (Frontend Lead), your previous order is rescinded. The project's frontend framework has been approved: Next.js. Your new task is to produce a detailed frontend technical specification. This must include: 1. A comprehensive breakdown of the required UI components for all pages (e.g., `<Navbar>`, `<LoginForm>`, `<DocumentItem>`). 2. For each component, define its purpose, required props, and internal state management strategy. 3. A plan for managing global state (e.g., user authentication status). This specification will form a core part of the final DEP. Submit your report upon completion.\\\",\\n  \\\"orderID\\\": \\\"GIDEON-ORDER-KAELEN-02\\\"\\n}\\n###ORDER-GIDEON-ORDER-KAELEN-02###\"}]}],\"config\":{},\"tools\":[],\"output\":{}}}","genkit:state":"success"},"displayName":"generate","links":[],"instrumentationLibrary":{"name":"genkit-tracer","version":"v1"},"spanKind":"INTERNAL","sameProcessAsParentSpan":{"value":true},"status":{"code":0},"timeEvents":{"timeEvent":[]}}},"displayName":"generate","startTime":1751232733903,"endTime":1751232771775.2773}